  "description": "Estimates a dense, relative depth map from a single image: no stereo or sensor needed. Relative inverse depth (larger is nearer), any image size that is a multiple of 14. Uses: depth maps; 2.5D parallax and camera moves; depth-based bokeh and relighting; fog and atmosphere by depth.",
